  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Mvi 101.01 Purpose. The purpose of these rules is to establish the procedures under which the New Hampshire motor vehicle industry board, which regulates business practices among motor vehicle manufacturers, distributors and dealers, shall operate.\n\nSource. #6485, INTERIM, eff 4-16-97, EXPIRED: 8-14-97\n\nNew. #6650, eff 12-10-97",
